.TP
To enable tracing for selected modules:
.sp
.B cvdbset md_vnops rw fsmvnops fsmtoken fsmdmig
.PP
This enables tracing for only these five modules and prints the output:
.Cs
Setting md_vnops.
Setting rw.
Setting fsmvnops.
Setting fsmtoken.
Setting fsmdmig.
cvdb -m modules=0x0001000020148000 logmask=0xffffffffffffffff
.Ce
.PP
If an argument is preceded by a colon (:), then any module whose
name contains the argument as a substring is included.
.sp
To enable the md_vnops tracing module and all of the proxy-related modules:
.IP
.B cvdbset md_vnops :proxy
.PP
This displays the following output:
.Cs
